      "message": "Catalan runs on the check chain (task 135cf916)\n\nCatalan ran split: from 2026-11-03 to 2026-11-14 one of eight runs ended Lean Verified (#187), with\nbuild OOM-kills at 4, 3 and 2 Lake workers and five Lean checks at the 320-minute deadline. A chain\npassed #187 in two segments (run 43564338682: 14.0 and 8.7 GB). The profile gets runner github-chain,\nthe chain tools file, chain 4 build jobs, 4 check jobs, 30 hours and segment_parts 5 (the 3-SAT values;\nthe walk of #187 has about 111,000 declarations, so a part is about 22,000), and keeps\nlake_workers_start 1. Tests and docs follow. The site pins the profile, so the site trust commit\nchanges profiles[catalan] with it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
